                                                "text": "The car overheated because of a broken radiator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b283f37-2808-3516-a72f-09afd179fc70",
                                        "entry_id": "e7273216-41fe-3071-9c16-9c4ff67c6883",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A finned metal fixture that carries hot water or steam in order to heat a room."
